                                                "sense_id": "7b27ca2f-34d0-3a8d-aca6-a4feceb3d3ad",
                                                "text": "At a recent meeting at Mint Plaza’s Blue Bottle Coffee, Maggiotto ordered a Gibraltar, a small, milky espresso drink."
